vor
===

vor is a Go port (independent re-implementation) of repowise.

Upstream / original work
------------------------
repowise — https://github.com/repowise-dev/repowise
Copyright (C) 2024-2026 Raghav Chamadiya and contributors
Licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License, either version 3 of
the License, or (at your option) any later version.

vor derives its design and feature set from repowise: the dependency-graph
model, the code-health biomarkers, decision mining, the generation/wiki
pipeline, and the MCP tool surface all originate in that project. No
upstream source code was copied verbatim — vor is a fresh implementation in
Go — but it is unmistakably a derivative work, and it is distributed under
the same license out of both obligation and respect for the original.

